# PLANORA AI — INDEPENDENT BRUTAL TECHNICAL AUDIT

## Objective: Determine the REAL Score of the Project Across All Six Evaluation Parameters

Act as a completely independent principal software architect, senior security auditor, performance engineer, QA lead, accessibility specialist, and competitive coding evaluator.

Your responsibility is to evaluate the actual Planora AI application as strictly as possible.

The project is being evaluated on six parameters:

1. Code Quality
2. Security
3. Efficiency
4. Testing
5. Accessibility
6. Problem Statement Alignment

Each parameter is evaluated out of 100.

I previously asked for improvements targeting 100/100 in every category. However, I now want an independent, brutally honest verification of the actual results.

**DO NOT ASSUME THAT THE PROJECT DESERVES 100/100 JUST BECAUSE PREVIOUS IMPLEMENTATION TASKS WERE COMPLETED.**

